PTX tensormap+fence.release+acquire-fence
"tensormap.replace, a plain fence.release (not a proxy fence), fence.proxy.tensormap::generic.acquire, then a tensor copy through the map. The acquire tensormap fence needs a release tensormap fence to pair with (D37); a plain release fence does not order across proxies, so the copy may use the old map: allowed."
{
g=5;
d=0 @cta 0;
b=mbarrier(1) @cta 0;
tm=0;
P0:r2=0;
}
 P0@cta 0,cluster 0,gpu 0                                                                         ;
 tensormap.replace.tile.global_address.global.b1024.b64 tm, 1                                     ;
 fence.release.gpu                                                                                ;
 fence.proxy.tensormap::generic.acquire.gpu tm, 128                                               ;
 cp.async.bulk.tensor.1d.shared::cluster.global.tile.mbarrier::complete_tx::bytes d, g, b, tm, r2 ;
exists
(P0:r2 == 0)
